        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 7.48m (24'6\") x 1.13m (3'8\")\nTiled flooring\n\nRoom - 3.03m (9'11\") x 3.99m (13'1\")\n\nRoom - 3.09m (10'2\") x 3.41m (11'2\")\n\nBathroom - 3.08m (10'1\") x 3.41m (11'2\")\nFully plumbed with whb, bath and walk -in electric shower\n\nHallway - 4.59m (15'1\") x 3.51m (11'6\")\n\nRoom - 3.61m (11'10\") x 3.58m (11'9\")\nFully plumbed with whb\n\nRoom - 2.66m (8'9\") x 3.83m (12'7\")\nFully plumbed with whb\n\nHall - 2.67m (8'9\") x 2.05m (6'9\")\n\nRoom - 6.26m (20'6\") x 3.53m (11'7\")\n\nRoom - 4.4m (14'5\") x 3.31m (10'10\")\n\nCorridor - 1.31m (4'4\") x 3.36m (11'0\")\n\nBathroom - 2.62m (8'7\") x 4.37m (14'4\")\nFully plumbed with whb and bath\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 4.48m (14'8\") x 4.64m (15'3\")\nVinyl flooring and with a range of integrated appliances\n\nLanding - 4.49m (14'9\") x 2.25m (7'5\")\n\nSitting Room - 4.49m (14'9\") x 4.35m (14'3\")\nElegant and cosy living area with carpet flooring, feature fireplace and TV points\n\nHallway - 2.44m (8'0\") x 5.86m (19'3\")\n\nW/C - 2.78m (9'1\") x 1.71m (5'7\")\nFully plumbed with whb, bath and walk- in electric shower\n\nHallway - 3.67m (12'0\") x 2.83m (9'3\")\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.13m (13'7\") x 4.64m (15'3\")\nOpen plan kitchen/dining area with a range of integrated appliances\n\nLiving Room - 6.19m (20'4\") x 4.64m (15'3\")\nSpacious living area with wood laminate flooring, TV points and sliding doors to rear garden\n\nSun Room/ Conservatory - 2.29m (7'6\") x 3.85m (12'8\")\nConservatory has a lovely mix of indoor comfort and outdoor beauty, with large conservatory windows that boasts the natural light and door to access rear garden this is the perfect place to relax\n\nHall - 0.96m (3'2\") x 1.26m (4'2\")\n\nRoom - 4.44m (14'7\") x 4.64m (15'3\")\nLarge double bedroom with fitted wardrobes\n\nRoom - 4.9m (16'1\") x 4.64m (15'3\")\nLarge double bedroom with fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 1.73m (5'8\") x 1.99m (6'6\")\nFully plumbed with whb\n\nStorage - 4.